Package: omicsApp
Title: Shiny Web Interface for Multi-Omics Analysis
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Weilin", "Pu", email = "puweilin@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A modern Shiny application providing interactive visualization
    and analysis for proteomics and transcriptomics data, powered by the
    omicsCore engine. Features smart input parsing (auto-detects expression
    matrix, sample metadata, and feature annotation), dual-omics integration
    views (RNA-Protein correlation, joint pathway enrichment), and cached
    reactive pipelines for responsive UI on commodity hardware.
